  "description": ".NET client for the Macula mesh on the macula 12 wire: TLS 1.3 with a hybrid post-quantum key exchange, ML-DSA-87 identities, signed calls, replies and publications. Node keys, a pool of station links, calls and streams by direct dial, serving in a node's own namespace or under an org, publish/subscribe, node-served content and the DHT. Built on libmacula, macula-go behind a C ABI, shipped in the package for Linux (x64, arm64), macOS (x64, arm64) and Windows (x64).",
